concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nl a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536NL Guide to this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536nl ;
    values:originalText "This Part is about the coverage and operation of the provisions of this Chapter. Division 2 sets out when road transport contractual chain orders and road transport contractual chain guidelines cover persons in a road transport contractual chain. Division 3 specifies the rules relating to the interaction of the provisions of this Chapter with State and Territory laws." ;
    skos:definition "This Part is about the coverage and operation of the provisions of this Chapter. Division 2 sets out when road transport contractual chain orders and road transport contractual chain guidelines cover persons in a road transport contractual chain. Division 3 specifies the rules relating to the interaction of the provisions of this Chapter with State and Territory laws."@en ;
