concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nn a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536NN FWC to have regard to minimum standards objective"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536nn ;
    values:originalText "The FWC must have regard to the minimum standards objective in performing a function or exercising a power under this Chapter. Note: The FWC must also have regard to the road transport objective as required by section 40D.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    skos:definition "The FWC must have regard to the minimum standards objective in performing a function or exercising a power under this Chapter. Note: The FWC must also have regard to the road transport objective as required by section 40D.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain"@en ;
