doc:sec-536np a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536NP Contravening a road transport contractual chain order" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A person must not contravene a term of a road transport contractual chain order. Note 1: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: A person does not contravene a term of a road transport contractual chain order unless the order applies to the person: see subsection 536NQ(1)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536NQ The significance of a road transport contractual chain order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536nq ;
    values:originalText "applying to a person (1) A road transport contractual chain order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a road transport contractual chain order, unless the order applies to the person. (2) A road transport contractual chain order does not give a person an entitlement unless the order applies to the person.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Core provisions for this Chapter  Part 3B-1 Provisions relating to coverage and operation of road transport contractual chain orders and road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 2 Section 536NR Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 536NR  When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a person When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker (1) A road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker in a road transport contractual chain if: (a) the road transport contractual chain order covers the regulated road transport contractor or road transport employee-like worker; and (b) the road transport contractual chain order is in operation; and (c) no other provision of this Act provides, or has the effect, that the road transport contractual chain order does not apply to the regulated road transport contractor or road transport employee-like worker. When a road transport contractual chain order applies to other persons in a road transport contractual chain (2) A road transport contractual chain order applies to a person in a road transport contractual chain, other than a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker, if: (a) the road transport contractual chain order covers the person; and (b) a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker to whom the road transport contractual chain order applies, or an employee, performs work for the person; and (c) the road transport contractual chain order is in operation; and (d) no other provision of this Act provides, or has the effect, that the road transport contractual chain order does not apply to the person.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    skos:definition "applying to a person (1) A road transport contractual chain order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a road transport contractual chain order, unless the order applies to the person. (2) A road transport contractual chain order does not give a person an entitlement unless the order applies to the person.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Core provisions for this Chapter  Part 3B-1 Provisions relating to coverage and operation of road transport contractual chain orders and road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 2 Section 536NR Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 536NR  When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a person When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker (1) A road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker in a road transport contractual chain if: (a) the road transport contractual chain order covers the regulated road transport contractor or road transport employee-like worker; and (b) the road transport contractual chain order is in operation; and (c) no other provision of this Act provides, or has the effect, that the road transport contractual chain order does not apply to the regulated road transport contractor or road transport employee-like worker. When a road transport contractual chain order applies to other persons in a road transport contractual chain (2) A road transport contractual chain order applies to a person in a road transport contractual chain, other than a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker, if: (a) the road transport contractual chain order covers the person; and (b) a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker to whom the road transport contractual chain o"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d72f27b8bf3de0b45f8d15914e1df6957f6d5b97d88907d10295b95c15a1e620" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.32" .
doc:sec-536nq a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536NQ The significance of a road transport contractual chain order" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "applying to a person (1) A road transport contractual chain order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a road transport contractual chain order, unless the order applies to the person. (2) A road transport contractual chain order does not give a person an entitlement unless the order applies to the person.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Core provisions for this Chapter  Part 3B-1 Provisions relating to coverage and operation of road transport contractual chain orders and road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 2 Section 536NR Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 536NR  When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a person When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker (1) A road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker in a road transport contractual chain if: (a) the road transport contractual chain order covers the regulated road transport contractor or road transport employee-like worker; and (b) the road transport contractual chain order is in operation; and (c) no other provision of this Act provides, or has the effect, that the road transport contractual chain order does not apply to the regulated road transport contractor or road transport employee-like worker. When a road transport contractual chain order applies to other persons in a road transport contractual chain (2) A road transport contractual chain order applies to a person in a road transport contractual chain, other than a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker, if: (a) the road transport contractual chain order covers the person; and (b) a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker to whom the road transport contractual chain order applies, or an employee, performs work for the person; and (c) the road transport contractual chain order is in operation; and (d) no other provision of this Act provides, or has the effect, that the road transport contractual chain order does not apply to the person.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536NQ(1) The significance of a road transport contractual chain order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536nq-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A road transport contractual chain order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a road transport contractual chain order, unless the order applies to the person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A road transport contractual chain order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a road transport contractual chain order, unless the order applies to the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a88db246eb20bb00cc6aafdda4fa31b3e38d0ac25ae179b323e843d2d36a633f" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person is not obligated to comply with a road transport contractual chain order unless it applies to them. A road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker if certain conditions are met." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.32" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq-ss-1-norm .
