doc:sec-536nq-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536NQ(1) The significance of a road transport contractual chain order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A road transport contractual chain order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a road transport contractual chain order, unless the order applies to the person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536NQ(2) The significance of a road transport contractual chain order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536nq-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A road transport contractual chain order does not give a person an entitlement unless the order applies to the person.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Core provisions for this Chapter  Part 3B-1 Provisions relating to coverage and operation of road transport contractual chain orders and road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 2 Section 536NR Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 536NR  When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a person When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A road transport contractual chain order does not give a person an entitlement unless the order applies to the person.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Core provisions for this Chapter  Part 3B-1 Provisions relating to coverage and operation of road transport contractual chain orders and road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 2 Section 536NR Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 536NR  When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a person When a road transport contractual chain order applies to a regulated road transport contractor or a road transport employee-like worker"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2c409338ee5067e13be1319c9484317a35399d74d47bc91c5eb7ec8a9ec63ad2" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nq ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A road transport contractual chain order applies to a person in a road transport contractual chain. A road transport contractual chain order applies to a person only if it applies to them." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
