doc:sec-536p-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536P(1) Authorisation of conduct for the purposes of the Competition" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of subsection 51(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, and the Competition Code within the meaning of that Act, anything done in accordance with a road transport contractual chain order or road transport contractual chain  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Core provisions for this Chapter  Part 3B-1 Exclusion of certain State and Territory laws  Division 3 Section 536P Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 guidelines by a person or entity covered by the order or guidelines is specified in and specifically authorised by this Act. Certain conduct not protected" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536p-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536P(2) Authorisation of conduct for the purposes of the Competition"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536p-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Despite subsection (1), conduct referred to in that subsection is not specified in or specifically authorised by this Act if the conduct is: (a) making a contract or arrangement, or arriving at an understanding, that is or contains a cartel provision that satisfies the purpose condition in either paragraph 45AD(3)(a) or (b) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 or the Competition Code within the meaning of that Act; or (b) boycott conduct within the meaning of subsection 87AA(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 or the Competition Code within the meaning of that Act.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Despite subsection (1), conduct referred to in that subsection is not specified in or specifically authorised by this Act if the conduct is: (a) making a contract or arrangement, or arriving at an understanding, that is or contains a cartel provision that satisfies the purpose condition in either paragraph 45AD(3)(a) or (b) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 or the Competition Code within the meaning of that Act; or (b) boycott conduct within the meaning of subsection 87AA(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 or the Competition Code within the meaning of that Act.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7b8201f27dfd99694c271c64dd53fa72d55961d0ecc8cc2fb0c30bba918ca6b6" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536p ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conduct is not specified or authorised if it contains a cartel provision or boycott conduct." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
