    values:originalText "(1) Any of the following may apply to the FWC for the making of a road transport contractual chain order: (a) an organisation that is entitled to represent the industrial interests of one or more persons in a road transport contractual chain; (b) a regulated business in a road transport contractual chain;  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Any of the following may apply to the FWC for the making of a road transport contractual chain order: (a) an organisation that is entitled to represent the industrial interests of one or more persons in a road transport contractual chain; (b) a regulated business in a road transport contractual chain;  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain"@en ;
