doc:sec-536pe a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536PE Applications for road transport contractual chain orders" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Any of the following may apply to the FWC for the making of a road transport contractual chain order: (a) an organisation that is entitled to represent the industrial interests of one or more persons in a road transport contractual chain; (b) a regulated business in a road transport contractual chain;  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pf a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536PF Particular matters FWC must take into account in making a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536pf ;
    values:originalText "decision on a road transport contractual chain order (1) This section applies if: (a) an application is made for a road transport contractual chain order under subsection 536PE(1) or for a variation of a road transport contractual chain order under section 536PS; or (b) the FWC is considering making or varying a road transport contractual chain order on its own initiative. (2) The FWC: (a) must not make or vary the road transport contractual chain order unless there has been genuine engagement with the parties to be covered; and (b) must not make or vary the road transport contractual chain order unless the Road Transport Advisory Group has been consulted; and  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    skos:definition "decision on a road transport contractual chain order (1) This section applies if: (a) an application is made for a road transport contractual chain order under subsection 536PE(1) or for a variation of a road transport contractual chain order under section 536PS; or (b) the FWC is considering making or varying a road transport contractual chain order on its own initiative. (2) The FWC: (a) must not make or vary the road transport contractual chain order unless there has been genuine engagement with the parties to be covered; and (b) must not make or vary the road transport contractual chain order unless the Road Transport Advisory Group has been consulted; and  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5ca46531878534153da7aab24aaf8e3ae52760874c78593ae9930868d79748d1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "45"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pf-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pf-ss-2 ;
