concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pf-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536PF(2) Particular matters FWC must take into account in making a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536pf-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The FWC: (a) must not make or vary the road transport contractual chain order unless there has been genuine engagement with the parties to be covered; and (b) must not make or vary the road transport contractual chain order unless the Road Transport Advisory Group has been consulted; and  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The FWC: (a) must not make or vary the road transport contractual chain order unless there has been genuine engagement with the parties to be covered; and (b) must not make or vary the road transport contractual chain order unless the Road Transport Advisory Group has been consulted; and  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f7fa4838137263487492addf6a5b4201dd20aeec40838f333b3c6abaf6c29fc0" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pf ;
    cof:pageNumber "45"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "FWC must engage with parties and consult the Road Transport Advisory Group before making or varying a road transport contractual chain order." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
