concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536PG FWC to prepare and publish a draft of a road transport"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536pg ;
    values:originalText "contractual chain order (1) Before making a road transport contractual chain order, the FWC must: (a) publish a notice (a notice of intent) stating that the FWC proposes to make a road transport contractual chain order; and  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain orders  Division 2 Section 536PH Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) publish a draft of the proposed road transport contractual chain order. (2) The FWC must publish the notice of intent and the draft of the road transport contractual chain order on the FWC’s website and by any other means the FWC considers appropriate." ;
    skos:definition "contractual chain order (1) Before making a road transport contractual chain order, the FWC must: (a) publish a notice (a notice of intent) stating that the FWC proposes to make a road transport contractual chain order; and  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain orders  Division 2 Section 536PH Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) publish a draft of the proposed road transport contractual chain order. (2) The FWC must publish the notice of intent and the draft of the road transport contractual chain order on the FWC’s website and by any other means the FWC considers appropriate."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "920dd82123a471f789e81b1747bceb357921139342ba4996b6df454c538d4c5e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "46"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pg-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pg-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.46" .
