doc:sec-536pj-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536PJ(2) Finalising draft order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If changes made under subsection (1) are significant, the FWC must: (a) decide not to make the road transport contractual chain order based on the draft; and (b) publish a subsequent notice of intent under paragraph 536PG(1)(a) in relation to the revised draft road transport contractual chain order, and publish the revised draft; and (c) follow the process set out in section 536PH (as affected by subsection (3) or (4) of this section) in relation to the revised draft road transport contractual chain order." ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pj-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536PJ(3) Finalising draft order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536pj-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(c), the period of consultation under section 536PH in relation to the revised draft road transport contractual chain order is to be the period of at least 12 months  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain orders  Division 2 Section 536PK Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 starting when the subsequent notice of intent and the revised draft required by paragraph (2)(b) of this section were published (the draft publication time)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(c), the period of consultation under section 536PH in relation to the revised draft road transport contractual chain order is to be the period of at least 12 months  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain orders  Division 2 Section 536PK Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 starting when the subsequent notice of intent and the revised draft required by paragraph (2)(b) of this section were published (the draft publication time)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "89af7f134861a72b59f97c7be76565d7f82365c7d259e648b936efdd2a7c7c3e" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pj ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines the period of consultation for a revised draft road transport contractual chain order" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
