doc:sec-536pj-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536PJ(3) Finalising draft order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(c), the period of consultation under section 536PH in relation to the revised draft road transport contractual chain order is to be the period of at least 12 months  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain orders  Division 2 Section 536PK Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 starting when the subsequent notice of intent and the revised draft required by paragraph (2)(b) of this section were published (the draft publication time)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pj-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536PJ(4) Finalising draft order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536pj-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, the FWC may reduce that 12-month period to another period that the FWC considers is reasonable if: (a) the order is a time-sensitive road transport contractual chain order; or (b) the FWC is satisfied that the circumstances urgently require it, and the period is at least 6 months starting from the draft publication time." ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, the FWC may reduce that 12-month period to another period that the FWC considers is reasonable if: (a) the order is a time-sensitive road transport contractual chain order; or (b) the FWC is satisfied that the circumstances urgently require it, and the period is at least 6 months starting from the draft publication time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "16b3fd7b45ef48ed91c54fc44bf09532526bda41ece56cf13a9aa5fdca894799" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pj ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "FWC may reduce 12-month period for time-sensitive road transport contractual chain order." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.48" ;
