concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pm-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536PM(3) Terms that must be included in a road transport contractual"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536pm-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2): (a) persons in a road transport contractual chain other than regulated road transport contractors or road transport employee-like workers may be specified by name or by inclusion in a specified class or specified classes; and (b) regulated road transport contractors and road transport employee-like workers must be specified by inclusion in a specified class or specified classes." ;
