concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pm-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536PM(4) Terms that must be included in a road transport contractual"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536pm-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting the way in which a class may be described for the purposes of subsection (3), the class may be described by reference to a particular industry or sector, or part of an industry or sector, or particular kinds of work.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain orders  Division 2 Section 536PN Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Without limiting the way in which a class may be described for the purposes of subsection (3), the class may be described by reference to a particular industry or sector, or part of an industry or sector, or particular kinds of work.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain orders  Division 2 Section 536PN Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fe3dd42d26de33910e26aef18fb72e2859c7294b67729686d328a6541cb3e21e" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536pm ;
