doc:sec-536pv-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536PV(3) Limitations on making a deferral declaration" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subject to subsection (4), the Minister may make more than one part deferral declaration in relation to a particular road transport contractual chain order.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Deferral and suspension of road transport contractual chain orders  Division 3 Section 536PW Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
