concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536qc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536QC Limitations on making a deferral determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536qc ;
    values:originalText "No deferral of road transport contractual chain order that is in operation (1) The FWC must not make a deferral determination in relation to a road transport contractual chain order that has already come into operation. Only one full deferral determination is permitted, etc. (2) The FWC:  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    skos:definition "No deferral of road transport contractual chain order that is in operation (1) The FWC must not make a deferral determination in relation to a road transport contractual chain order that has already come into operation. Only one full deferral determination is permitted, etc. (2) The FWC:  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "32067f6d2331e30609a54e47bf2540d36a71dfe5304e040a736f82bfdd538754" ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer ;
