doc:sec-536qg-ss-5a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536QG(5A) FWC may make a determination suspending a road" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5A) The relevant period for a road transport contractual chain order is: (a) 12 months, unless paragraph (b) applies; and (b) for a time-sensitive road transport contractual chain order—3 months.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
