concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536qm-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536QM(6) Affected entities to have a reasonable opportunity to make"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536qm-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of subsection (1), an affected entity, in relation to a proposed variation or revocation of a road transport contractual chain order in relation to which a notice of intent has been published under paragraph 536QL(1)(a), is: (a) a person or body likely to be affected by the proposed variation or revocation; or (b) a person or body prescribed by the regulations, or belonging to a class of persons or bodies prescribed by the regulations.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of subsection (1), an affected entity, in relation to a proposed variation or revocation of a road transport contractual chain order in relation to which a notice of intent has been published under paragraph 536QL(1)(a), is: (a) a person or body likely to be affected by the proposed variation or revocation; or (b) a person or body prescribed by the regulations, or belonging to a class of persons or bodies prescribed by the regulations.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d1dab7194072b3c9ff34bd704434bc6e2232f705f68d642e1e97bae2faaf1b6e" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536qm ;
    cof:pageNumber "76"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Affected entities must be notified of proposed variation or revocation of road transport contractual chain order." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
