doc:sec-536qn-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536QN(3) Finalising draft order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(c), the period of consultation under section 536QM in relation to the revised draft road transport contractual chain order is to be the period of at least 12 months starting when the subsequent notice of intent and the revised draft required by paragraph (2)(b) of this section were published." ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536qn-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536QN(4) Finalising draft order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536qn-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, the FWC may reduce that 12-month period to another period that the FWC considers is reasonable if the order is a time-sensitive road transport contractual chain order.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 5 Section 536QP Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, the FWC may reduce that 12-month period to another period that the FWC considers is reasonable if the order is a time-sensitive road transport contractual chain order.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 5 Section 536QP Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "aa6f6fbc694ada256c6bc64f864499ca28ff3c510f8bea2ef49c4bad09af2c47" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536qn ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "FWC may reduce 12-month period for time-sensitive road transport contractual chain orders." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.78" ;
