doc:sec-536qn-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536QN(4) Finalising draft order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, the FWC may reduce that 12-month period to another period that the FWC considers is reasonable if the order is a time-sensitive road transport contractual chain order.  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 5 Section 536QP Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536qp a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536QP Road transport contractual chain guidelines"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536qp ;
    values:originalText "(1) The FWC may make guidelines under this section (road transport contractual chain guidelines) that set standards for regulated road transport contractors, road transport employee-like workers and other persons in a road transport contractual chain. (2) The FWC may make road transport contractual chain guidelines under this section: (a) on its own initiative; or (b) on application under section 536QQ." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The FWC may make guidelines under this section (road transport contractual chain guidelines) that set standards for regulated road transport contractors, road transport employee-like workers and other persons in a road transport contractual chain. (2) The FWC may make road transport contractual chain guidelines under this section: (a) on its own initiative; or (b) on application under section 536QQ."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "213dc78b6b4de77264cae1c13d90be0bdbd04c44e8daea913e9e95d8afcf6e55" ;
    cof:pageNumber "79"^^xsd:integer ;
