concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536qw-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536QW(3) FWC may vary or revoke road transport contractual chain"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536qw-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The FWC may make a determination varying road transport contractual chain guidelines to remove an ambiguity or uncertainty or to correct an error.  Chapter 3B  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain" ;
