concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536qx a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536QX Applications to vary or revoke road transport contractual"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536qx ;
    values:originalText "chain guidelines Any of the following may apply to the FWC for a determination varying or revoking road transport contractual chain guidelines: (a) an organisation that is entitled to represent the industrial interests of one or more of the persons covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines, or that would be covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines as proposed to be varied; (b) a regulated business covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines, or that would be covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines as proposed to be varied; (c) a person who is a primary party to the first contract or arrangement in a road transport contractual chain covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines, or that would  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 5 Section 536QX Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 be covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines as proposed to be varied; (d) the Minister; (e) a person or body prescribed by the regulations.  Chapter 4  Compliance and enforcement" ;
    skos:definition "chain guidelines Any of the following may apply to the FWC for a determination varying or revoking road transport contractual chain guidelines: (a) an organisation that is entitled to represent the industrial interests of one or more of the persons covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines, or that would be covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines as proposed to be varied; (b) a regulated business covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines, or that would be covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines as proposed to be varied; (c) a person who is a primary party to the first contract or arrangement in a road transport contractual chain covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines, or that would  Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Chapter 3B Minimum standards for persons in a road transport contractual chain  Part 3B-2 Road transport contractual chain guidelines  Division 5 Section 536QX Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 be covered by the road transport contractual chain guidelines as proposed to be varied; (d) the Minister; (e) a person or body prescribed by the regulations.  Chapter 4  Compliance and enforcement"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8eb909050595888fa1641903efe3265f9db1bb8f9f9d09c61a3335cd86655a0f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Any of the following may apply for a determination varying or revoking road transport contractual chain guidelines." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.82" ;
