concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-545a-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "545A(5) Orders relating to casual loading amounts"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-545a-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) To avoid doubt, an entitlement referred to in subsection (4) includes any such entitlement that has accrued but is untaken.  Chapter 4  Compliance and enforcement" ;
