concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-548-ss-1b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "548(1B) Plaintiffs may choose small claims procedure"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-548-ss-1b ;
    values:originalText "(1B) Proceedings are also to be dealt with as small claims proceedings under this section if: (a) a person applies for an order (other than a pecuniary penalty order) under Division 2 from a magistrates court or the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) in connection with a dispute relating to one or more of the following matters: (v) whether a person has contravened subsection 333E(1) (limitations on fixed term contracts);  Compliance and enforcement  Chapter 4 Civil remedies  Part 4-1 Small claims procedure  Division 3 Section 548 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (vi) whether subsection 333G(1) (effect of entering prohibited fixed term contract) applies in relation to a contract; and (b) the person applying for the order indicates, in a manner prescribed by the regulations or by the rules of the court, that he or she wants the small claims procedure to apply to the proceedings." ;
    skos:definition "(1B) Proceedings are also to be dealt with as small claims proceedings under this section if: (a) a person applies for an order (other than a pecuniary penalty order) under Division 2 from a magistrates court or the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) in connection with a dispute relating to one or more of the following matters: (v) whether a person has contravened subsection 333E(1) (limitations on fixed term contracts);  Compliance and enforcement  Chapter 4 Civil remedies  Part 4-1 Small claims procedure  Division 3 Section 548 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (vi) whether subsection 333G(1) (effect of entering prohibited fixed term contract) applies in relation to a contract; and (b) the person applying for the order indicates, in a manner prescribed by the regulations or by the rules of the court, that he or she wants the small claims procedure to apply to the proceedings."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6d8cc2f8ccb1d3d478a3926343483d0c41e928be9f0d5fca0e470ac89f594687" ;
