concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-550 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "550 Involvement in contravention treated in same way as actual"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-550 ;
    values:originalText "contravention (1) A person who is involved in a contravention of a civil remedy provision is taken to have contravened that provision. Note: If a person (the involved person) is taken under this subsection to have contravened a civil remedy provision, the involved person’s contravention may be a serious contravention (see subsection 557A(5A)). Serious contraventions attract higher maximum penalties (see subsection 539(2)). (2) A person is involved in a contravention of a civil remedy provision if, and only if, the person: (a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured the contravention; or (b) has induced the contravention, whether by threats or promises or otherwise; or (c) has been in any way, by act or omission, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in or party to the contravention; or (d) has conspired with others to effect the contravention." ;
    skos:definition "contravention (1) A person who is involved in a contravention of a civil remedy provision is taken to have contravened that provision. Note: If a person (the involved person) is taken under this subsection to have contravened a civil remedy provision, the involved person’s contravention may be a serious contravention (see subsection 557A(5A)). Serious contraventions attract higher maximum penalties (see subsection 539(2)). (2) A person is involved in a contravention of a civil remedy provision if, and only if, the person: (a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured the contravention; or (b) has induced the contravention, whether by threats or promises or otherwise; or (c) has been in any way, by act or omission, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in or party to the contravention; or (d) has conspired with others to effect the contravention."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5578b00de301eb967b5ed954a490090955618f4bf243a72bc0671a5d523cd9b5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-550-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-550-ss-2 ;
