concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-554 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "554 Criminal proceedings after civil proceedings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-554 ;
    values:originalText "Criminal proceedings may be commenced against a person for conduct that is substantially the same as conduct constituting a contravention of a civil remedy provision regardless of whether an order has been made against the person under Division 2." ;
