    values:originalText "admissible in criminal proceedings (1) Evidence of information given, or evidence of production of documents, by an individual is not admissible in criminal proceedings against the individual if: (a) the individual previously gave the information or produced the documents in proceedings for a pecuniary penalty order  Chapter 4  Compliance and enforcement" ;
    cof:pageNumber "137"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-556 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "556 Civil double jeopardy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-556 ;
    values:originalText "If a person is ordered to pay a pecuniary penalty under a civil remedy provision in relation to particular conduct, the person is not liable to be ordered to pay a pecuniary penalty under some other provision of a law of the Commonwealth in relation to that conduct. Note: A court may make other orders, such as an order for compensation, in relation to particular conduct even if the court has made a pecuniary penalty order in relation to that conduct (see subsection 546(5))." ;
    skos:definition "If a person is ordered to pay a pecuniary penalty under a civil remedy provision in relation to particular conduct, the person is not liable to be ordered to pay a pecuniary penalty under some other provision of a law of the Commonwealth in relation to that conduct. Note: A court may make other orders, such as an order for compensation, in relation to particular conduct even if the court has made a pecuniary penalty order in relation to that conduct (see subsection 546(5))."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b1435bf908e6721329d1f5c41d50b26ab7f2d2475719f66ab81976ddbbc340c5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "138"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No double liability for pecuniary penalties under different laws." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.138" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-556-norm .
concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-556-norm a values:Obligation ;
