doc:sec-557a-ss-5a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "557A(5A) Serious contravention of civil remedy provisions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5A) A person (the involved person) who is involved in a contravention of a civil remedy provision by another person (the principal) commits a serious contravention of the provision only if: (a) the principal’s contravention was a serious contravention; and (b) the involved person knew that the principal’s contravention was a serious contravention.  Chapter 4  Compliance and enforcement" ;
