concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-557b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "557B Liability of bodies corporate for serious contravention"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-557b ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of subsection 557A(1), a body corporate knowingly contravenes a civil remedy provision if the body corporate expressly, tacitly or impliedly authorised the contravention. (2) This section does not limit section 793." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of subsection 557A(1), a body corporate knowingly contravenes a civil remedy provision if the body corporate expressly, tacitly or impliedly authorised the contravention. (2) This section does not limit section 793."@en ;
