concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-558 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "558 Regulations dealing with infringement notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-558 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may provide for a person who is alleged to have contravened a civil remedy provision to pay a penalty to the Commonwealth as an alternative to civil proceedings.  Chapter 4  Compliance and enforcement" ;
