concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-558a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "558A Meaning of franchisee entity and responsible franchisor entity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-558a ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person is a franchisee entity of a franchise if: (a) the person is a franchisee (including a subfranchisee) in relation to the franchise; and (b) the business conducted by the person under the franchise is substantially or materially associated with intellectual property relating to the franchise. (2) A person is a responsible franchisor entity for a franchisee entity of a franchise if: (a) the person is a franchisor (including a subfranchisor) in relation to the franchise; and (b) the person has a significant degree of influence or control over the franchisee entity’s affairs." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person is a franchisee entity of a franchise if: (a) the person is a franchisee (including a subfranchisee) in relation to the franchise; and (b) the business conducted by the person under the franchise is substantially or materially associated with intellectual property relating to the franchise. (2) A person is a responsible franchisor entity for a franchisee entity of a franchise if: (a) the person is a franchisor (including a subfranchisor) in relation to the franchise; and (b) the person has a significant degree of influence or control over the franchisee entity’s affairs."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "90309ee4789b9c5010df9051d7d8841fcbfa2c40e5bbdb4c033a1bfba5399254" ;
    cof:pageNumber "145"^^xsd:integer ;
