concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-572 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "572 Regulations dealing with matters relating to court proceedings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-572 ;
    values:originalText "The regulations may provide for the fees to be charged in relation to proceedings in a court (including a court of a State or Territory) under this Act.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Introduction  Division 1 Section 573 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Chapter 5—Administration" ;
    skos:definition "The regulations may provide for the fees to be charged in relation to proceedings in a court (including a court of a State or Territory) under this Act.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Introduction  Division 1 Section 573 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Chapter 5—Administration"@en ;
