concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-580 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "580 Protection of FWC Members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-580 ;
    values:originalText "An FWC Member has, in performing his or her functions or exercising his or her powers as an FWC Member, the same protection and immunity as a Justice of the High Court. Note: See also section 584B (which deals with protection of persons involved in handling etc. complaints about FWC Members). Subdivision B—Functions and powers of the President" ;
    skos:definition "An FWC Member has, in performing his or her functions or exercising his or her powers as an FWC Member, the same protection and immunity as a Justice of the High Court. Note: See also section 584B (which deals with protection of persons involved in handling etc. complaints about FWC Members). Subdivision B—Functions and powers of the President"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "87acb5f3c4fb92c61c7ba2b7a417c0a7e4ea7773081d8cc2c40cbe2de93fab6d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "166"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Protection of FWC Members" ;
