concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-581 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "581 Functions of the President"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-581 ;
    values:originalText "The President is responsible for ensuring that the FWC performs its functions and exercises its powers in a manner that: (a) is efficient; and (b) adequately serves the needs of employers and employees throughout Australia; and (c) adequately serves the needs of persons covered by Chapter 3A; and (d) adequately serves the needs of persons covered by Chapter 3B.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Establishment and functions of the Fair Work Commission  Division 2 Section 581A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note: The President must perform his or her own functions and exercise his or her own powers in a manner that facilitates cooperation with prescribed State industrial authorities (see section 649)." ;
    skos:definition "The President is responsible for ensuring that the FWC performs its functions and exercises its powers in a manner that: (a) is efficient; and (b) adequately serves the needs of employers and employees throughout Australia; and (c) adequately serves the needs of persons covered by Chapter 3A; and (d) adequately serves the needs of persons covered by Chapter 3B.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Establishment and functions of the Fair Work Commission  Division 2 Section 581A Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note: The President must perform his or her own functions and exercise his or her own powers in a manner that facilitates cooperation with prescribed State industrial authorities (see section 649)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1c0e32ef5ac652a1739864dbbc0e7fa1fa6d0337a24cdbbbcf3e3c836f8be731" ;
    cof:pageNumber "166"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ensure efficient and adequate performance of FWC functions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.166" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-581-norm .
