concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-584 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "584 Delegation of functions and powers of the President"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-584 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The President may, in writing, delegate to a Vice President or a Deputy President all or any of the President’s functions or powers, other than under:  Chapter 5  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The President may, in writing, delegate to a Vice President or a Deputy President all or any of the President’s functions or powers, other than under:  Chapter 5  Administration"@en ;
