doc:sec-584b-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "584B(2) Protection of persons involved in handling etc. complaints" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A witness requested to attend, or appearing, before a complaint handler or any other person, in relation to a complaint about an FWC Member, has the same protection, and is subject to the same liabilities in proceedings, as a witness in a case tried by the High Court." ;
