concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-584b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "584B(3) Protection of persons involved in handling etc. complaints"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-584b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A lawyer assisting, or appearing on behalf of a person before, a complaint handler or any other person, in relation to a complaint about an FWC Member, has the same protection and immunity as a barrister has in appearing for a party in proceedings in the High Court.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Conduct of matters before the FWC  Division 3 Section 585 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A lawyer assisting, or appearing on behalf of a person before, a complaint handler or any other person, in relation to a complaint about an FWC Member, has the same protection and immunity as a barrister has in appearing for a party in proceedings in the High Court.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Conduct of matters before the FWC  Division 3 Section 585 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bd43d55d1cbe8d72da377c4d3a0913387938daabb849b38a0976031dffa9ede2" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-584b ;
