concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-588 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "588 Discontinuing applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-588 ;
    values:originalText "A person who has applied to the FWC may discontinue the application: (a) in accordance with the procedural rules (if any); and (b) whether or not the matter has been settled. Subdivision B—Conduct of matters before the FWC" ;
    skos:definition "A person who has applied to the FWC may discontinue the application: (a) in accordance with the procedural rules (if any); and (b) whether or not the matter has been settled. Subdivision B—Conduct of matters before the FWC"@en ;
