    values:originalText "(1) The FWC may, except as provided by this Act, inform itself in relation to any matter before it in such manner as it considers appropriate.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Conduct of matters before the FWC  Division 3 Section 591 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "174"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-590-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "590(2) Powers of the FWC to inform itself"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-590-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the FWC may inform itself in the following ways: (a) by requiring a person to attend before the FWC; (b) by inviting, subject to any terms and conditions determined by the FWC, oral or written submissions; (c) by requiring a person to provide copies of documents or records, or to provide any other information to the FWC; (d) by taking evidence under oath or affirmation in accordance with the regulations (if any); (e) by requiring an FWC Member, a Full Bench or an Expert Panel to prepare a report; (f) by conducting inquiries; (g) by undertaking or commissioning research; (h) by conducting a conference (see section 592); (i) by holding a hearing (see section 593)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the FWC may inform itself in the following ways: (a) by requiring a person to attend before the FWC; (b) by inviting, subject to any terms and conditions determined by the FWC, oral or written submissions; (c) by requiring a person to provide copies of documents or records, or to provide any other information to the FWC; (d) by taking evidence under oath or affirmation in accordance with the regulations (if any); (e) by requiring an FWC Member, a Full Bench or an Expert Panel to prepare a report; (f) by conducting inquiries; (g) by undertaking or commissioning research; (h) by conducting a conference (see section 592); (i) by holding a hearing (see section 593)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dd17f791eecfa9c6ac758828c25c8c238d862176a9b25f20feb8687b7e7b1fde" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-590 ;
    cof:pageNumber "174"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The FWC may inform itself in various ways." ;
