doc:sec-601-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "601(4) Writing and publication requirements for the FWC’s decisions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The FWC must publish the following, on its website or by any other means that the FWC considers appropriate: (a) a decision that is required to be in writing and any written reasons that the FWC gives in relation to such a decision; (b) an enterprise agreement that has been approved by the FWC under Part 2-4. The FWC must do so as soon as practicable after making the decision or approving the agreement." ;
    cof:pageNumber "181"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-601-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "601(5) Writing and publication requirements for the FWC’s decisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-601-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsection (4) does not apply to any of the following decisions or reasons in relation to such decisions: (a) a decision to issue, or refuse to issue, a certificate under paragraph 368(3)(a) or 527R(3)(a); (c) a decision to issue an entry permit under section 512; (d) a decision to impose conditions on an entry permit under section 515; (e) a decision to issue, or refuse to issue, an exemption certificate under section 519;  Chapter 5  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsection (4) does not apply to any of the following decisions or reasons in relation to such decisions: (a) a decision to issue, or refuse to issue, a certificate under paragraph 368(3)(a) or 527R(3)(a); (c) a decision to issue an entry permit under section 512; (d) a decision to impose conditions on an entry permit under section 515; (e) a decision to issue, or refuse to issue, an exemption certificate under section 519;  Chapter 5  Administration"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "31e5c335f96b08093b067ad8773e8ea5ff378f07801b5c3c09f8fbcf9ede699a" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-601 ;
    cof:pageNumber "181"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from subsection (4) apply to certain decisions" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
