concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-602a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "602A(3) Validation of approval of enterprise agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-602a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the FWC makes a determination under subsection (1) in relation to an enterprise agreement that was made, the FWC must: (a) publish the agreement on the FWC’s website or by any other means that the FWC considers appropriate; and (b) do so as soon as practicable after making the determination." ;
