concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-603 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "603 Varying and revoking the FWC’s decisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-603 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The FWC may vary or revoke a decision of the FWC that is made under this Act (other than a decision referred to in subsection (3)). Note: If the FWC makes a decision to make an instrument, the FWC may vary or revoke the instrument under this subsection (see subsection 598(2)). (2) The FWC may vary or revoke a decision under this section: (a) on its own initiative; or (b) on application by: (i) a person who is affected by the decision; or (ii) if the kind of decision is prescribed by the regulations— a person prescribed by the regulations in relation to that kind of decision. (3) The FWC must not vary or revoke any of the following decisions of the FWC under this section: (a) a decision under Part 2-3 (which deals with modern awards);  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Conduct of matters before the FWC  Division 3 Section 604 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) a decision under section 235 or Division 4, 7, 9 or 10 of" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The FWC may vary or revoke a decision of the FWC that is made under this Act (other than a decision referred to in subsection (3)). Note: If the FWC makes a decision to make an instrument, the FWC may vary or revoke the instrument under this subsection (see subsection 598(2)). (2) The FWC may vary or revoke a decision under this section: (a) on its own initiative; or (b) on application by: (i) a person who is affected by the decision; or (ii) if the kind of decision is prescribed by the regulations— a person prescribed by the regulations in relation to that kind of decision. (3) The FWC must not vary or revoke any of the following decisions of the FWC under this section: (a) a decision under Part 2-3 (which deals with modern awards);  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Conduct of matters before the FWC  Division 3 Section 604 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) a decision under section 235 or Division 4, 7, 9 or 10 of"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7494ce193deb8e45020f62e472bd4465d8db2a8d9b801a3ddbb78eb963200af2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "184"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-603-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-603-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-603-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.184" .
