concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-615c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "615C Transfer to the President from an FWC Member or a Full"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-615c ;
    values:originalText "Bench (1) This section applies if: (a) the President decides to perform a function or exercise a power; and (b) before the President made that decision, the President had given a direction (the earlier direction) that the function be  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Organisation of the FWC  Division 4 Section 616 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 performed or the power be exercised by a Full Bench or an FWC Member. (2) The President is taken to have revoked the earlier direction. (3) The President must, when performing the function or exercising the power, take into account: (a) everything that occurred before the FWC; and (b) everything that the FWC did; in relation to the matter before the President began to perform the function or exercise the power." ;
    skos:definition "Bench (1) This section applies if: (a) the President decides to perform a function or exercise a power; and (b) before the President made that decision, the President had given a direction (the earlier direction) that the function be  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Organisation of the FWC  Division 4 Section 616 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 performed or the power be exercised by a Full Bench or an FWC Member. (2) The President is taken to have revoked the earlier direction. (3) The President must, when performing the function or exercising the power, take into account: (a) everything that occurred before the FWC; and (b) everything that the FWC did; in relation to the matter before the President began to perform the function or exercise the power."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3f8c65be8e28b2f7c5f1fc56d549ba57c853441c6cfbdfa57bd32deaf7e25c52" ;
    cof:pageNumber "194"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-615c-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-615c-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-615c-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
