    values:originalText "(1) The appointment of a Judge of a court created by the Parliament as an FWC Member, or service by such a Judge as an FWC Member, does not affect: (a) the Judge’s tenure of office as a Judge; or (b) the Judge’s rank, title, status, precedence, salary, annual or other allowances or other rights or privileges as the holder of his or her office as a Judge." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The appointment of a Judge of a court created by the Parliament as an FWC Member, or service by such a Judge as an FWC Member, does not affect: (a) the Judge’s tenure of office as a Judge; or (b) the Judge’s rank, title, status, precedence, salary, annual or other allowances or other rights or privileges as the holder of his or her office as a Judge."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "70bb7cb971ef3053d3e12fc6b6bcc8d004cd0b9bab8b79d5881b00db72ea2769" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-629a ;
    cof:pageNumber "217"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No effect on Judge's tenure or rank." ;
