concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-638 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "638 Remuneration of Deputy Presidents or Commissioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-638 ;
    values:originalText "performing duties on a part-time basis (1) If the President approves a Deputy President or Commissioner (the part-time member) performing his or her duties on a part-time basis, the President and the part-time member are to enter into a written agreement specifying the proportion (the agreed proportion) of full-time duties to be worked by the part-time member. (2) The agreed proportion may be varied by a written agreement between the President and the part-time member.  Chapter 5  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "performing duties on a part-time basis (1) If the President approves a Deputy President or Commissioner (the part-time member) performing his or her duties on a part-time basis, the President and the part-time member are to enter into a written agreement specifying the proportion (the agreed proportion) of full-time duties to be worked by the part-time member. (2) The agreed proportion may be varied by a written agreement between the President and the part-time member.  Chapter 5  Administration"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "737655081c6dfd2b73ce10feef8fb02e5c3ce283cb033de75586364b097f5a79" ;
