concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-645 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "645 Resignation of FWC Members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-645 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An FWC Member may resign his or her appointment by giving the Governor-General a written resignation. (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Governor-General or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day." ;
