concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-649 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "649 President to cooperate with prescribed State industrial"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-649 ;
    values:originalText "authorities (1) The President must perform his or her functions, and exercise his or her powers, in a manner that facilitates and encourages cooperation between the FWC and prescribed State industrial authorities. (2) Without limiting subsection (1), the President may invite the heads of prescribed State industrial authorities, or the principal registrars of prescribed State industrial authorities, to meet with the President to exchange information and discuss matters of mutual interest in relation to workplace relations." ;
    skos:definition "authorities (1) The President must perform his or her functions, and exercise his or her powers, in a manner that facilitates and encourages cooperation between the FWC and prescribed State industrial authorities. (2) Without limiting subsection (1), the President may invite the heads of prescribed State industrial authorities, or the principal registrars of prescribed State industrial authorities, to meet with the President to exchange information and discuss matters of mutual interest in relation to workplace relations."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9756757b8c6dd29422388434c0fda529a4a8b5bc95d590808b958a1d60325117" ;
    cof:pageNumber "236"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-649-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-649-ss-2 ;
