    cof:title "651(4) Seals" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The seal of the FWC, and the duplicates of that seal, are to be kept in such custody as the President directs and must not be used except as authorised by the President. Note: The President gives directions under section 582. Judicial notice of the seal of the FWC" ;
