concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-653 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "653 Reports about making enterprise agreements, individual"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-653 ;
    values:originalText "flexibility arrangements etc. Review and research (1) The General Manager must: (a) review the developments, in Australia, in making enterprise agreements; and (b) conduct research into the extent to which individual flexibility arrangements under modern awards and enterprise agreements are being agreed to, and the content of those arrangements; and (c) conduct research into the operation of the provisions of the National Employment Standards relating to: (i) requests for flexible working arrangements under subsection 65(1); and (ii) requests for extensions of unpaid parental leave under subsection 76(1); and  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Seals and additional powers and functions of the President and the General Manager" ;
    skos:definition "flexibility arrangements etc. Review and research (1) The General Manager must: (a) review the developments, in Australia, in making enterprise agreements; and (b) conduct research into the extent to which individual flexibility arrangements under modern awards and enterprise agreements are being agreed to, and the content of those arrangements; and (c) conduct research into the operation of the provisions of the National Employment Standards relating to: (i) requests for flexible working arrangements under subsection 65(1); and (ii) requests for extensions of unpaid parental leave under subsection 76(1); and  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Seals and additional powers and functions of the President and the General Manager"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2fc35556c9906e0f7174926a3183473ef4471c6dea6e1cde86e58cd972e568df" ;
    cof:pageNumber "238"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Review and research on enterprise agreements, flexibility arrangements, and National Employment Standards." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.238" ;
