concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-655 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "655 Disclosure of information by the FWC"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-655 ;
    values:originalText "Information to which this section applies (1) This section applies to the following information: (a) information acquired by the FWC, or a member of the staff of the FWC, in the course of performing functions or exercising powers as the FWC; (b) information acquired by a person in the course of assisting the FWC under section 672, or in the course of performing functions, or exercising powers, as a consultant under section 673.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Seals and additional powers and functions of the President and the General Manager" ;
    skos:definition "Information to which this section applies (1) This section applies to the following information: (a) information acquired by the FWC, or a member of the staff of the FWC, in the course of performing functions or exercising powers as the FWC; (b) information acquired by a person in the course of assisting the FWC under section 672, or in the course of performing functions, or exercising powers, as a consultant under section 673.  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 Seals and additional powers and functions of the President and the General Manager"@en ;
