concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-670 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "670 Staff"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-670 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The staff of the FWC must be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999. (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999: (a) the General Manager and the staff of the FWC together constitute a Statutory Agency; and (b) the General Manager is the Head of that Statutory Agency." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The staff of the FWC must be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999. (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999: (a) the General Manager and the staff of the FWC together constitute a Statutory Agency; and (b) the General Manager is the Head of that Statutory Agency."@en ;
