concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-671 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "671 Delegation by General Manager to staff"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-671 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The General Manager may, in writing, delegate all or any of his or her functions or powers to: (a) a member of the staff of the FWC who is an SES employee or acting SES employee; or  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 General Manager, staff and consultants  Division 8 Section 672 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) a member of the staff of the FWC who is in a class of employees prescribed by the regulations. (2) In performing functions or exercising powers under a delegation, the delegate must comply with any directions of the General Manager. Note: See also sections 34AA and 34AB of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The General Manager may, in writing, delegate all or any of his or her functions or powers to: (a) a member of the staff of the FWC who is an SES employee or acting SES employee; or  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 General Manager, staff and consultants  Division 8 Section 672 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) a member of the staff of the FWC who is in a class of employees prescribed by the regulations. (2) In performing functions or exercising powers under a delegation, the delegate must comply with any directions of the General Manager. Note: See also sections 34AA and 34AB of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "47f41796daf43c7fa188b724f0e382eafa701694ae09c03c2b2bf34f8a12e925" ;
    cof:pageNumber "246"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-671-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-671-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.246" .
