doc:sec-671-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "671(1) Delegation by General Manager to staff" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The General Manager may, in writing, delegate all or any of his or her functions or powers to: (a) a member of the staff of the FWC who is an SES employee or acting SES employee; or  Administration  Chapter 5 The Fair Work Commission  Part 5-1 General Manager, staff and consultants  Division 8 Section 672 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) a member of the staff of the FWC who is in a class of employees prescribed by the regulations." ;
    cof:pageNumber "246"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-671-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "671(2) Delegation by General Manager to staff"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-671-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) In performing functions or exercising powers under a delegation, the delegate must comply with any directions of the General Manager. Note: See also sections 34AA and 34AB of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
