concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-672 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "672 Persons assisting the FWC"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-672 ;
    values:originalText "The FWC may also be assisted: (a) by employees of Agencies (within the meaning of the Public Service Act 1999); or (b) by officers and employees of a State or Territory; or (c) by officers and employees of authorities of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; whose services are made available to the FWC in connection with the performance of any of its functions." ;
    skos:definition "The FWC may also be assisted: (a) by employees of Agencies (within the meaning of the Public Service Act 1999); or (b) by officers and employees of a State or Territory; or (c) by officers and employees of authorities of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; whose services are made available to the FWC in connection with the performance of any of its functions."@en ;
