concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-674 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "674 Offences in relation to the FWC"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-674 ;
    values:originalText "Insulting or disturbing an FWC Member (1) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person engages in conduct; and (b) the person’s conduct insults or disturbs an FWC Member in the performance of functions, or the exercise of powers, as an FWC Member. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months. Using insulting language (2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person uses insulting language towards another person; and (b) the person is reckless as to whether the language is insulting; and (c) the other person is an FWC Member performing functions, or exercising powers, as an FWC Member. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months. Interrupting matters before the FWC (3) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person engages in conduct; and (b) the person’s conduct interrupts a matter before the FWC. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.  Chapter 5  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "Insulting or disturbing an FWC Member (1) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person engages in conduct; and (b) the person’s conduct insults or disturbs an FWC Member in the performance of functions, or the exercise of powers, as an FWC Member. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months. Using insulting language (2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person uses insulting language towards another person; and (b) the person is reckless as to whether the language is insulting; and (c) the other person is an FWC Member performing functions, or exercising powers, as an FWC Member. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months. Interrupting matters before the FWC (3) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person engages in conduct; and (b) the person’s conduct interrupts a matter before the FWC. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.  Chapter 5  Administration"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3205e972a39ec380a51a8068aa0c77b38e4494e63f03d864f5e6c40c42122aee" ;
    cof:pageNumber "249"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-674-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-674-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-674-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.249" .
