    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-682-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Before publishing a compliance and enforcement policy under paragraph (1)(da), the Fair Work Ombudsman must consult with the National Workplace Relations Consultative Council about the guidelines referred to in that paragraph." ;
