concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-688 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "688 Remuneration of the Fair Work Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-688 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Fair Work Ombudsman is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the Fair Work Ombudsman is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations. (2) The Fair Work Ombudsman is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the regulations. (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Fair Work Ombudsman is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the Fair Work Ombudsman is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations. (2) The Fair Work Ombudsman is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the regulations. (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d32cf3c851e60b58fd79e13ac383c478eb29f1aa37862c97dc3806213e98e70e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "260"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-688-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-688-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-688-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.260" .
