concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-696-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "696(2) Establishment of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-696-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman consists of: (a) the Fair Work Ombudsman; and (b) the staff of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman; and (c) the inspectors appointed under section 700." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman consists of: (a) the Fair Work Ombudsman; and (b) the staff of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman; and (c) the inspectors appointed under section 700."@en ;
