concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-696-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "696(3) Establishment of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-696-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013): (a) the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman is a listed entity; and (b) the Fair Work Ombudsman is the accountable authority of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman; and (c) the following persons are officials of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman: (i) the Fair Work Ombudsman; (ii) the staff of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman; (iii) the inspectors appointed under section 700; (iv) persons whose services are made available to the Fair Work Ombudsman under section 698; (v) consultants engaged under section 699; and (d) the purposes of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman include: (i) the functions of the Fair Work Ombudsman referred to in section 682; and (ii) the functions of inspectors under Subdivision D.  Chapter 5  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013): (a) the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman is a listed entity; and (b) the Fair Work Ombudsman is the accountable authority of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman; and (c) the following persons are officials of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman: (i) the Fair Work Ombudsman; (ii) the staff of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman; (iii) the inspectors appointed under section 700; (iv) persons whose services are made available to the Fair Work Ombudsman under section 698; (v) consultants engaged under section 699; and (d) the purposes of the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman include: (i) the functions of the Fair Work Ombudsman referred to in section 682; and (ii) the functions of inspectors under Subdivision D.  Chapter 5  Administration"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "95f9f53e19515b9ffc2a87bf8a0c87c6aaeb479d345fb406764ed989b1a10027" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-696 ;
    cof:pageNumber "263"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Listed entity and accountable authority" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
