    values:originalText "The Fair Work Ombudsman may engage persons having suitable qualifications and experience as consultants to the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman.  Administration  Chapter 5 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Part 5-2 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Division 3 Section 700 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Subdivision C—Appointment of Fair Work Inspectors" ;
