concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-703 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "703 Conditions and restrictions on functions and powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-703 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The functions, and powers (compliance powers), conferred on an inspector are subject to such conditions and restrictions as are specified in his or her instrument of appointment. (2) To avoid doubt, the power to apply for the issue of an FWO notice under section 712AA and the power to give an FWO notice under section 712AD are not compliance powers.  Administration  Chapter 5 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Part 5-2 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Division 3 Section 704 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The functions, and powers (compliance powers), conferred on an inspector are subject to such conditions and restrictions as are specified in his or her instrument of appointment. (2) To avoid doubt, the power to apply for the issue of an FWO notice under section 712AA and the power to give an FWO notice under section 712AD are not compliance powers.  Administration  Chapter 5 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Part 5-2 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Division 3 Section 704 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
