concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-704 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "704 General directions by the Fair Work Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-704 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Fair Work Ombudsman may, by legislative instrument, give a written direction to inspectors relating to the performance of their functions or the exercise of their powers as inspectors. (2) The direction must be of a general nature only, and cannot relate to a particular case. (3) An inspector must comply with the direction." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Fair Work Ombudsman may, by legislative instrument, give a written direction to inspectors relating to the performance of their functions or the exercise of their powers as inspectors. (2) The direction must be of a general nature only, and cannot relate to a particular case. (3) An inspector must comply with the direction."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d2d004a189aa28e6a30d05308ca071b111371a0220b5a5657a0585a2fb89225b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "267"^^xsd:integer ;
