doc:sec-712ad-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "712AD(3) Fair Work Ombudsman may give FWO notice to person in" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If: (a) the Fair Work Ombudsman gives an FWO notice to a person under subsection (1); and (b) the time specified in the notice under paragraph 712AC(b), (c) or (d) is not at least 14 days after the notice is given to the person; the Fair Work Ombudsman must, at the same time as the FWO notice is given to the person, also give notice to the person of a time later than the time specified in the notice." ;
    cof:pageNumber "277"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-712ad-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "712AD(4) Fair Work Ombudsman may give FWO notice to person in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-712ad-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Fair Work Ombudsman may, at any time after giving an FWO notice to the person in relation to whom it is issued, give notice to the person of a time later than the time: (a) specified in the notice under paragraph 712AC(b), (c) or (d); or (b) notified under subsection (3)." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Fair Work Ombudsman may, at any time after giving an FWO notice to the person in relation to whom it is issued, give notice to the person of a time later than the time: (a) specified in the notice under paragraph 712AC(b), (c) or (d); or (b) notified under subsection (3)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "22e220a836d8ebb84c490d09565578974ec9ddc37ab487f6cf73f3efc5ecbaae" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-712ad ;
