doc:sec-712f-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "712F(5) Review and report by Commonwealth Ombudsman" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) The exercise of those powers in relation to a review by the Ombudsman under this section is taken, for all purposes, to be an exercise of powers under the Ombudsman Act 1976. Commonwealth Ombudsman to report to Parliament" ;
    cof:pageNumber "280"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-712f-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "712F(6) Review and report by Commonwealth Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-712f-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) As soon as practicable after the end of each quarter of each financial year, the Commonwealth Ombudsman must prepare and present to the Parliament a report about examinations conducted during that quarter. The report must include the results of reviews conducted under this section during that quarter." ;
    skos:definition "(6) As soon as practicable after the end of each quarter of each financial year, the Commonwealth Ombudsman must prepare and present to the Parliament a report about examinations conducted during that quarter. The report must include the results of reviews conducted under this section during that quarter."@en ;
