concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-712f-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "712F(7) Review and report by Commonwealth Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-712f-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) The Commonwealth Ombudsman may prepare and present to the Parliament any other reports about the results of reviews conducted under this section the Commonwealth Ombudsman considers appropriate.  Chapter 5  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "(7) The Commonwealth Ombudsman may prepare and present to the Parliament any other reports about the results of reviews conducted under this section the Commonwealth Ombudsman considers appropriate.  Chapter 5  Administration"@en ;
