concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-717g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "717G Relationship with other powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-717g ;
    values:originalText "(1) Whether a cooperation agreement is in force in relation to particular conduct does not affect: (a) the power of the Fair Work Ombudsman to accept an enforceable undertaking under section 715 in relation to the conduct; or (b) the power of an inspector to give a notice under section 716 in relation to the conduct; or (c) any other power or function of the Fair Work Ombudsman or an inspector that is not mentioned in subsection 717A(1). (2) However: (a) an enforceable undertaking has no effect to the extent that it is inconsistent with a cooperation agreement; and (b) a compliance notice has no effect to the extent that an action specified in the notice is inconsistent with a cooperation agreement.  Administration  Chapter 5 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Part 5-2 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Division 3 Section 718 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 This subsection has effect regardless of whether the undertaking or notice was given before or after the cooperation agreement comes into force. Subdivision E—Disclosure of information by the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Whether a cooperation agreement is in force in relation to particular conduct does not affect: (a) the power of the Fair Work Ombudsman to accept an enforceable undertaking under section 715 in relation to the conduct; or (b) the power of an inspector to give a notice under section 716 in relation to the conduct; or (c) any other power or function of the Fair Work Ombudsman or an inspector that is not mentioned in subsection 717A(1). (2) However: (a) an enforceable undertaking has no effect to the extent that it is inconsistent with a cooperation agreement; and (b) a compliance notice has no effect to the extent that an action specified in the notice is inconsistent with a cooperation agreement.  Administration  Chapter 5 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Part 5-2 Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman  Division 3 Section 718 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 This subsection has effect regardless of whether the undertaking or notice was given before or after the cooperation agreement comes into force. Subdivision E—Disclosure of information by the Office of the Fair Work Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "19afd98fb1b2c4b107f911382c6d9ff67f0d3aa697000f88d25adbcacc3e0c88" ;
    cof:pageNumber "292"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-717g-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-717g-ss-2 ;
