    cof:title "718A(5) False or misleading information or documents" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsection (1) does not apply if, before the information was given or the document was produced by a person to the official, the official did not take reasonable steps to inform the person that the person may be liable to a civil remedy for contravening subsection (1)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "294"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-718a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "718A(6) False or misleading information or documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-718a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of subsection (5), it is sufficient if the following form of words is used: “You may be liable to a civil remedy for giving false or misleading information or producing false or misleading documents”.  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
