    skos:prefLabel "720 Meanings of employee and employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-720 ;
    values:originalText "In this Part, employee and employer have their ordinary meanings. Note: See also Division 2 of Part 6-4A (TCF contract outworkers taken to be employees in certain circumstances).  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Multiple actions  Part 6-1 Certain actions not permitted if alternative action can be taken  Division 2 Section 721 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
