concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-750 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "750 Modification of meaning of full rate of pay for pieceworkers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-750 ;
    values:originalText "Section 18 has effect as if the following paragraph were added at the end of subsection 18(2): (d) the employee is a non-national system employee, and the regulations prescribe, or provide for the determination of, the employee’s full rate of pay for the purposes of the extended parental leave provisions." ;
    skos:definition "Section 18 has effect as if the following paragraph were added at the end of subsection 18(2): (d) the employee is a non-national system employee, and the regulations prescribe, or provide for the determination of, the employee’s full rate of pay for the purposes of the extended parental leave provisions."@en ;
