concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-752 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "752 Modification of meaning of ordinary hours of work—if not"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-752 ;
    values:originalText "determined by State industrial instrument Section 20 has effect as if references in subsections 20(1), (2) and (3) to an award/agreement free employee also included references to a non-national system employee to whom either of the following paragraphs applies: (a) a State industrial instrument applies to the employee, but it does not specify, or provide for the determination of, the employee’s ordinary hours of work; (b) no State industrial instrument applies to the employee.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Extension of National Employment Standards entitlements  Part 6-3 Extension of entitlement to unpaid parental leave and related entitlements  Division 2 Section 753 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "determined by State industrial instrument Section 20 has effect as if references in subsections 20(1), (2) and (3) to an award/agreement free employee also included references to a non-national system employee to whom either of the following paragraphs applies: (a) a State industrial instrument applies to the employee, but it does not specify, or provide for the determination of, the employee’s ordinary hours of work; (b) no State industrial instrument applies to the employee.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Extension of National Employment Standards entitlements  Part 6-3 Extension of entitlement to unpaid parental leave and related entitlements  Division 2 Section 753 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "75d9829bad1f3fb639fadc02051f7617eacb904df5736bbe901ab1d64aff691b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "318"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "References to an award/agreement free employee also include non-national system employees." ;
