    skos:prefLabel "757A Object of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-757a ;
    values:originalText "The object of this Division is to give effect, or further effect, to: (a) paragraph (f) of Article 10 of the ILO Convention (No. 190) concerning Violence and Harassment, done at Geneva on" ;
