    values:originalText "(b) the Violence and Harassment Recommendation, 2019 (Recommendation No. 206), which the General Conference of the ILO adopted on 21 June 2019; by providing employees with an entitlement to paid family and domestic violence leave that will help mitigate the impact of domestic violence in the world of work. Note: The Convention and the Recommendation could in 2022 be viewed on the ILO website (http://www.ilo.org)." ;
