doc:sec-759-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "759(2) Extending entitlement to notice of termination or payment in" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The related provisions are the following, so far as they apply in relation to Subdivision A of Division 11 of Part 2-2 as it applies because of subsection (1): (a) the provisions of Division 2, Subdivision C of Division 11, and Division 13, of Part 2-2; (b) any other provisions of this Act prescribed by the regulations; (c) any provisions of this Act that define expressions that are used (directly or indirectly) in provisions of Subdivision A of Division 11 of Part 2-2, or in provisions referred to in paragraph (a) or (b) of this subsection. Modifications are set out in Subdivision B" ;
    cof:pageNumber "326"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-759-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "759(3) Extending entitlement to notice of termination or payment in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-759-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The extended notice of termination provisions have effect subject to the modifications provided for in Subdivision B. The extended notice of termination provisions are the provisions of Subdivision A of Division 11 of Part 2-2, and the related provisions identified in subsection (2) of this section, as they apply because of this section. Regulations made for the purpose of provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The extended notice of termination provisions have effect subject to the modifications provided for in Subdivision B. The extended notice of termination provisions are the provisions of Subdivision A of Division 11 of Part 2-2, and the related provisions identified in subsection (2) of this section, as they apply because of this section. Regulations made for the purpose of provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "56419371eedf3f36c441324a8a9a0bb11ddb5a34867c4ea5486541c3950df144" ;
