concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ay a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "768AY Termination in limited circumstances"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-768ay ;
    values:originalText "(1) A copied State instrument for a transferring employee cannot be terminated except under items 22, 23, 24, 25 and 26 of Schedule 3A to the Transitional Act (which deal with termination of State employment agreements) as those items have effect because of section 768BY. (2) A copied State instrument for a transferring employee that has been terminated ceases to operate and can never operate again. Note: A copied State instrument that does not operate cannot cover a person (see subsection 768AN(6)).  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Transfer of business from a State public sector employer  Part 6-3A FWC orders about coverage of copied State instruments and other instruments  Division Section 768AZ Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A copied State instrument for a transferring employee cannot be terminated except under items 22, 23, 24, 25 and 26 of Schedule 3A to the Transitional Act (which deal with termination of State employment agreements) as those items have effect because of section 768BY. (2) A copied State instrument for a transferring employee that has been terminated ceases to operate and can never operate again. Note: A copied State instrument that does not operate cannot cover a person (see subsection 768AN(6)).  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Transfer of business from a State public sector employer  Part 6-3A FWC orders about coverage of copied State instruments and other instruments  Division Section 768AZ Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "21e277b5e8d889a994bf7a9bad8a9d31f64c0b4c534ddb9d79b5093ebb749a4b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "352"^^xsd:integer ;
