    skos:prefLabel "768BE Consolidation order to deal with application and coverage"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-768be ;
    values:originalText "(1) A consolidation order under subsection 768BD(1) must specify when the copied State instrument for employee A applies to, and covers: (a) another transferring employee; and  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
