    skos:definition "(1) Service of a transferring employee with the old State employer that: (a) occurred before the employee’s termination time; and (b) counted for the purposes of the application to the employee of the original State award or original State agreement for the copied State instrument for the employee; also counts as service of the employee with the new employer for the purposes of the application to the employee of the copied State instrument after the employee’s re-employment time. Gap between termination time and re-employment time"@en ;
