concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-768bw a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "768BW Application of this Act to take-home pay orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-768bw ;
    values:originalText "This Act applies as if the following provisions included a reference to a take-home pay order: (a) subsection 675(2) (which is about FWC orders); (b) subsection 706(2) (which is about powers of inspectors). Subdivision E—Modification of this Act" ;
