    skos:definition "(2) The notice must be in the form (if any) prescribed by the regulations and set out: (a) the reasons for the terminations; and  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Additional provisions relating to termination of employment  Part 6-4 Notification and consultation requirements relating to certain terminations of employment  Division 3 Section 786 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) the number and categories of employees likely to be affected; and (c) the time when, or the period over which, the employer intends to carry out the terminations."@en ;
