concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789AA Guide to this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789aa ;
    values:originalText "This Part contains special provisions about TCF outworkers. Division 2 provides for TCF contract outworkers to be taken to be employees in certain circumstances for the purposes of most of the provisions of this Act. Division 3 provides for TCF outworkers (whether employees or contractors) to recover unpaid remuneration from entities that are indirectly responsible for work done by the outworkers. Division 4 allows the regulations to prescribe a code dealing with standards of conduct and practice relating to TCF outwork. Division 5 contains miscellaneous provisions." ;
    skos:definition "This Part contains special provisions about TCF outworkers. Division 2 provides for TCF contract outworkers to be taken to be employees in certain circumstances for the purposes of most of the provisions of this Act. Division 3 provides for TCF outworkers (whether employees or contractors) to recover unpaid remuneration from entities that are indirectly responsible for work done by the outworkers. Division 4 allows the regulations to prescribe a code dealing with standards of conduct and practice relating to TCF outwork. Division 5 contains miscellaneous provisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a616e170dbc38ed334932d79a2bfb921f7127d7722089f33c0d4a683f8ee460a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "399"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Guide to this Part" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
