doc:sec-789bb-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "789BB(4) TCF contract outworkers taken to be employees in certain" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The objective is that a TCF contract outworker who is taken to be an employee in relation to TCF work should have the same rights and obligations in relation to the work as an employee would have if he or she were employed by the person referred to in paragraph (1)(b) to do the work." ;
