doc:sec-789dc-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "789DC(2) Persons on whom obligations may be imposed by TCF" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) This subsection applies to a person if the person is a national system employer that employs TCF outworkers. Note: For the purpose of this Division, the effect of Division 2 must be taken into account in determining whether a person is a national system employer that employs TCF outworkers." ;
