concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789dc-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789DC(4) Persons on whom obligations may be imposed by TCF"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789dc-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) This subsection applies to a person if: (a) the person arranges for TCF work to be performed; and (b) the work: (i) is to be performed by TCF outworkers; or (ii) is of a kind often performed by TCF outworkers; and (c) the work is to be performed indirectly: (i) for another person, being a Commonwealth outworker entity; and  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Special provisions about TCF outworkers  Part 6-4A Code of practice relating to TCF outwork  Division 4 Section 789DD Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (ii) if that Commonwealth outworker entity is a constitutional corporation—for the purposes of a business undertaking of that corporation." ;
    skos:definition "(4) This subsection applies to a person if: (a) the person arranges for TCF work to be performed; and (b) the work: (i) is to be performed by TCF outworkers; or (ii) is of a kind often performed by TCF outworkers; and (c) the work is to be performed indirectly: (i) for another person, being a Commonwealth outworker entity; and  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Special provisions about TCF outworkers  Part 6-4A Code of practice relating to TCF outwork  Division 4 Section 789DD Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (ii) if that Commonwealth outworker entity is a constitutional corporation—for the purposes of a business undertaking of that corporation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ae7ad71ea44a8e48c8d169692fe96e712f19ac1778b95d465dae162b416ccada" ;
