concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789ea a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789EA Part not intended to exclude or limit State or Territory laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789ea ;
    values:originalText "relating to outworkers (1) This Part is not intended to exclude or limit the operation of a law of a State or Territory (or an instrument made under a law of a State or Territory), to the extent that the law (or instrument) relates to outworkers and is capable of operating concurrently with this Part. (2) A reference in subsection (1) to this Part includes a reference to any regulations made for the purposes of this Part.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Workers bullied at work  Part 6-4B Introduction  Division 1 Section 789FA Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "relating to outworkers (1) This Part is not intended to exclude or limit the operation of a law of a State or Territory (or an instrument made under a law of a State or Territory), to the extent that the law (or instrument) relates to outworkers and is capable of operating concurrently with this Part. (2) A reference in subsection (1) to this Part includes a reference to any regulations made for the purposes of this Part.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Workers bullied at work  Part 6-4B Introduction  Division 1 Section 789FA Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "77c8e7104d7ed5904af5eb8a14a1742221579803c126cf691942515205a2bdb9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "416"^^xsd:integer ;
