doc:sec-789fc-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "789FC(2) Application for an FWC order to stop bullying" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not apply to reasonable management action carried out in a reasonable manner." ;
    cof:pageNumber "418"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789fc-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789FC(3) Application for an FWC order to stop bullying"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789fc-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If a person conducts a business or undertaking (within the meaning of the Work Health and Safety Act 2011) and either: (a) the person is: (i) a constitutional corporation; or (ii) the Commonwealth; or (iii) a Commonwealth authority; or (iv) a body corporate incorporated in a Territory; or (b) the business or undertaking is conducted principally in a Territory or Commonwealth place; then the business or undertaking is a constitutionally-covered business." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If a person conducts a business or undertaking (within the meaning of the Work Health and Safety Act 2011) and either: (a) the person is: (i) a constitutional corporation; or (ii) the Commonwealth; or (iii) a Commonwealth authority; or (iv) a body corporate incorporated in a Territory; or (b) the business or undertaking is conducted principally in a Territory or Commonwealth place; then the business or undertaking is a constitutionally-covered business."@en ;
