concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789fg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789FG Contravening an order to stop bullying"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789fg ;
    values:originalText "A person to whom an order under section 789FF applies must not contravene a term of the order. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1)." ;
