concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789fj a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789FJ Declarations by the Chief of the Defence Force"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789fj ;
    values:originalText "(1) Without limiting section 789FI, the Chief of the Defence Force may, by legislative instrument, declare that all or specified provisions of this Part do not apply in relation to a specified activity. (2) A declaration under subsection (1) may only be made with the approval of the Minister and, if made with that approval, has effect according to its terms.  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Without limiting section 789FI, the Chief of the Defence Force may, by legislative instrument, declare that all or specified provisions of this Part do not apply in relation to a specified activity. (2) A declaration under subsection (1) may only be made with the approval of the Minister and, if made with that approval, has effect according to its terms.  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "743c4f1428fe08fe257814024a6c0cb68a0f1bcbdbefbca7b05aff0790fd16cc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "421"^^xsd:integer ;
