doc:sec-31-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "31(3) December 2020" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A certificate under subsection (1) is to be known as a 10% decline in turnover certificate that covers the employer specified in the  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Coronavirus economic response  Part 6-4C Introduction  Division 1 Section 789GCD Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 certificate for the designated quarter applicable to the time specified in the certificate." ;
    cof:pageNumber "426"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-31-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31(4) December 2020"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-31-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If: (a) an employer is a small business employer; and (b) an individual who: (i) is, or is authorised by, the employer; and (ii) has knowledge of the financial affairs of the employer; makes a statutory declaration to the effect that the employer satisfied the 10% decline in turnover test for the designated quarter applicable to a specified time; the statutory declaration is taken to be a 10% decline in turnover certificate that covers the employer for the designated quarter applicable to the time specified in the statutory declaration. Note: For small business employer, see section 23.  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If: (a) an employer is a small business employer; and (b) an individual who: (i) is, or is authorised by, the employer; and (ii) has knowledge of the financial affairs of the employer; makes a statutory declaration to the effect that the employer satisfied the 10% decline in turnover test for the designated quarter applicable to a specified time; the statutory declaration is taken to be a 10% decline in turnover certificate that covers the employer for the designated quarter applicable to the time specified in the statutory declaration. Note: For small business employer, see section 23.  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bf588931072bfa11bd0e3506ccfb53674ee02484843e6cfafd9a456163fd235a" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-31 ;
    cof:pageNumber "426"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employer must make a statutory declaration to satisfy the 10% decline in turnover test." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
