concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789gr a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789GR Service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789gr ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, if an employee is subject to a jobkeeper enabling direction during a period, that period counts as service. (2) Subsection (1) has effect in addition to section 22.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Coronavirus economic response  Part 6-4C Accrual rules  Division 8 Section 789GS Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, if an employee is subject to a jobkeeper enabling direction during a period, that period counts as service. (2) Subsection (1) has effect in addition to section 22.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Coronavirus economic response  Part 6-4C Accrual rules  Division 8 Section 789GS Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bcf9178726dedc1533fc45a814a1de71305ac2b647b774a631855ddd7f4b4dd2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "428"^^xsd:integer ;
