concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789gv-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789GV(7) FWC may deal with a dispute about the operation of this"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789gv-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) In dealing with the dispute, the FWC must take into account fairness between the parties concerned.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Coronavirus economic response  Part 6-4C Dealing with disputes  Division 10 Section 789GW Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(7) In dealing with the dispute, the FWC must take into account fairness between the parties concerned.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Coronavirus economic response  Part 6-4C Dealing with disputes  Division 10 Section 789GW Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
