concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789gw a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789GW Contravening an FWC order dealing with a dispute about"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789gw ;
    values:originalText "the operation of this Part A person must not contravene a term of an FWC order dealing with a dispute about the operation of this Part. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1).  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
