concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789hc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789HC Constitutional basis of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789hc ;
    values:originalText "This Division relies on the Commonwealth’s legislative powers under paragraph 51(xxix) (external affairs) of the Constitution as it relates to giving effect to Australia’s obligations under: (a) the ILO Convention (No. 111) concerning Discrimination in respect of Employment and Occupation, done at Geneva on" ;
