concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-789hd-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "789HD(3) Extension of anti-discrimination rules"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-789hd-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In applying sections 30H and 30S in relation to that operation of the provisions identified in subsection (2), assume that: (a) the matter to which that operation of those provisions relates is not an excluded subject matter for the purposes of: (i) the State’s referral law mentioned in sections 30H and 30S; and (ii) Divisions 2A and 2B of Part 1-3; and  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(3) In applying sections 30H and 30S in relation to that operation of the provisions identified in subsection (2), assume that: (a) the matter to which that operation of those provisions relates is not an excluded subject matter for the purposes of: (i) the State’s referral law mentioned in sections 30H and 30S; and (ii) Divisions 2A and 2B of Part 1-3; and  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous"@en ;
