doc:sec-793-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "793(2) Liability of bodies corporate" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If, for the purposes of this Act (subject to subsection (3A)) or the procedural rules, it is necessary to establish the state of mind of a body corporate in relation to particular conduct, it is enough to show:  Miscellaneous  Chapter 6 Miscellaneous  Part 6-5 Miscellaneous  Division 2 Section 794 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (a) that the conduct was engaged in by a person referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b); and (b) that the person had that state of mind. Meaning of state of mind" ;
    cof:pageNumber "448"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-793-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "793(3) Liability of bodies corporate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-793-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The state of mind of a person includes: (a) the knowledge, intention, opinion, belief or purpose of the person; and (b) the person’s reasons for the intention, opinion, belief or purpose. Exception—offence relating to failure to pay amounts" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The state of mind of a person includes: (a) the knowledge, intention, opinion, belief or purpose of the person; and (b) the person’s reasons for the intention, opinion, belief or purpose. Exception—offence relating to failure to pay amounts"@en ;
