concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-794 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "794 Signature on behalf of body corporate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-794 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Act, a document may be signed on behalf of a body corporate by an authorised officer of the body and need not be made under the body’s seal.  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of this Act, a document may be signed on behalf of a body corporate by an authorised officer of the body and need not be made under the body’s seal.  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous"@en ;
