doc:sec-794a-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "794A(2) Liability of Australian governments under civil remedy" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Each of the following is an Australian government: (a) the Commonwealth; (b) a State; (c) the Australian Capital Territory; (d) the Northern Territory. Conduct of Australian governments" ;
