doc:sec-794a-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "794A(3) Liability of Australian governments under civil remedy" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Any conduct engaged in on behalf of an Australian government by an officer, employee or agent (an official) of the government within the scope of the official’s actual or apparent authority is taken, for the purposes of this Act and the procedural rules, to have been engaged in also by the government. State of mind of Australian governments" ;
    cof:pageNumber "450"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-794a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "794A(4) Liability of Australian governments under civil remedy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-794a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If, for the purposes of this Act or the procedural rules, it is necessary to establish the state of mind of an Australian government in relation to particular conduct, it is enough to show: (a) that the conduct was engaged in by an official of the government; and (b) that the official had that state of mind. Note: For state of mind, see subsection 793(3). Determining penalty amounts for Australian governments" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If, for the purposes of this Act or the procedural rules, it is necessary to establish the state of mind of an Australian government in relation to particular conduct, it is enough to show: (a) that the conduct was engaged in by an official of the government; and (b) that the official had that state of mind. Note: For state of mind, see subsection 793(3). Determining penalty amounts for Australian governments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "00be5c378eaece0155c521b502b1b5e3333f2b4b8343c2d135d5f86e5b26b825" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-794a ;
    cof:pageNumber "450"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Establishing state of mind of an Australian government in relation to conduct" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.450" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-794a-ss-4-norm .
