concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-795 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "795 Public sector employer to act through employing authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-795 ;
    values:originalText "Employer to act through employing authority (1) For the purposes of this Act and the procedural rules, the employer of an employee (a public sector employee) employed in public sector employment must act only through the employee’s employing authority acting on behalf of the employer. Acts done by or to employing authority (2) For the purposes of this Act and the procedural rules, anything done by or to a public sector employee’s employing authority acting on behalf of the employee’s employer is taken to have been done by or to the employer (as the case may be).  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "Employer to act through employing authority (1) For the purposes of this Act and the procedural rules, the employer of an employee (a public sector employee) employed in public sector employment must act only through the employee’s employing authority acting on behalf of the employer. Acts done by or to employing authority (2) For the purposes of this Act and the procedural rules, anything done by or to a public sector employee’s employing authority acting on behalf of the employee’s employer is taken to have been done by or to the employer (as the case may be).  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6d1ab8db60d9b08fc2a7517302614f27e87600398ce806d9a667aff94bc78e22" ;
    cof:pageNumber "455"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-795-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-795-ss-2 ;
