    skos:prefLabel "797 Regulations dealing with offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-797 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may provide for offences against the regulations. (2) The penalties for offences must not be more than 20 penalty units.  Chapter 6  Miscellaneous" ;
