concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-798 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "798 Regulations dealing with civil penalties"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-798 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may provide for civil penalties for contravention of the regulations. (2) The penalties for contravention must not be more than: (a) 20 penalty units for an individual; or (b) 100 penalty units for a body corporate." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The regulations may provide for civil penalties for contravention of the regulations. (2) The penalties for contravention must not be more than: (a) 20 penalty units for an individual; or (b) 100 penalty units for a body corporate."@en ;
