concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-800 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "800 Regulations dealing with exhibiting fair work instruments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-800 ;
    values:originalText "The regulations may provide for the exhibiting, on the premises of an employer, of a fair work instrument or a term of a fair work instrument." ;
    skos:definition "The regulations may provide for the exhibiting, on the premises of an employer, of a fair work instrument or a term of a fair work instrument."@en ;
